## Style

- B2 English. Short sentences. Bullets over long paragraphs.
- **No external links** — no Jira URLs, GitHub paths as links, Confluence, or “see another file”. Ticket keys as plain text (`VAP-2682`) are fine.
- **No dependency on other docs** — reader with only this export must understand the full proposal.
- Repo paths: plain monospace when helpful, not hyperlinks.
- Mermaid when clearer than text; follow workspace **diagrams** rule if installed.
- **API contract** must include copy-pasteable JSON examples and field tables.
- Keep implementation checklists short.

---

## Anti-patterns (do not)

| Do not | Do instead |
|--------|------------|
| Create `api-contract.md` + `rfc.md` | One RFC file per version with **API contract** section |
| Overwrite the same RFC file on version bump | New file under `rfc-docs/vX.Y-<stamp>.md` + update index |
| Link to Jira / GitHub / internal repos | Inline ticket key + schemas |
| Guess optional sections without AskQuestion | AskQuestion per section with recommended defaults |
| Skip section descriptions in AskQuestion | Every option gets a one-line description |
